schema_id: atlas.semantic-graph-search-plan
schema_version: 1
schema_kind: graph_search_plan
status: ACTIVE

description: >
  Parent Atlas production retrieval handoff from one canonical semantic lane to a
  bounded relationship-graph traversal. latent_64/latent_128 are routing hints;
  Qdrant or a hot CAGRA shard may produce semantic seeds; graph expansion then
  operates on structural/n-ary relationships and does not cast another semantic vote.

fields:
  schema: { type: literal, value: atlas.semantic-graph-search-plan.v1 }
  planId: { type: string, required: true }
  requestId: { type: string, required: true }
  workspaceRevision: { type: string, required: true }
  representationRevision: { type: string, required: true }
  graphRevision: { type: string, required: true }
  projectionRevision: { type: string, required: true }
  semanticRepresentation: { type: literal, value: semantic_768 }
  routingHints:
    type: object
    fields:
      useLatent64: { type: boolean }
      useLatent128: { type: boolean }
      latent64Revision: { type: string, nullable: true }
      latent128Revision: { type: string, nullable: true }
      shardIds: { type: string_array, default: [] }
      domainIds: { type: string_array, default: [] }
  seedStage:
    type: object
    fields:
      executor:
        type: enum
        values: [QDRANT, CAGRA_HOT_SHARD]
      topK: { type: integer, minimum: 1 }
      candidatePoolLimit: { type: integer, minimum: 1 }
      semanticVoteCount: { type: literal, value: 1 }
  graphStage:
    type: object
    fields:
      strategy:
        type: enum
        values: [WEIGHTED_BEST_FIRST, GREEDY_BEST_FIRST, BFS, SSSP, ASTAR_REFERENCE, PERSONALIZED_PAGERANK]
      heuristicId: { type: string, nullable: true }
      heuristicAdmissible: { type: boolean, default: false }
      maxDepth: { type: integer, minimum: 0 }
      maxEdgesVisited: { type: integer, minimum: 0 }
      maxFrontier: { type: integer, minimum: 1 }
      maxHyperedges: { type: integer, minimum: 0 }
      maxMembersPerHyperedge: { type: integer, minimum: 0 }
      maxWallTimeMs: { type: integer, minimum: 1 }
      maxGpuBytes: { type: integer, minimum: 0 }
      allowedRelationTypes: { type: string_array, default: [] }
  exactPromotionRequired: { type: literal, value: true }
  checksum: { type: string, required: true }
  producerRevision: { type: string, required: true }

invariants:
  - latent_64 and latent_128 are routing/topology hints and never evidence authority
  - semantic_768 is the canonical semantic representation
  - QDRANT and CAGRA_HOT_SHARD are mutually exclusive executors of one semantic seed stage
  - graph traversal starts after semantic Top-K seeding and does not emit an additional semantic vote
  - GREEDY_BEST_FIRST and WEIGHTED_BEST_FIRST are relevance strategies and do not claim shortest-path optimality
  - ASTAR_REFERENCE requires heuristicId plus heuristicAdmissible=true; otherwise the plan is invalid
  - A* remains a reference/helper strategy until a dedicated accelerated executor is independently proven
  - BFS is the unweighted minimum-hop path strategy; SSSP is the weighted nonnegative-cost path strategy
  - all projected binary edges retain relation/hyperedge provenance sufficient to reconstruct canonical n-ary evidence
  - exact promotion is mandatory before mutation-critical synthesis
